<h1>Time saved</h1>
<nav aria-label="Report period"><a href="?period=week">Last 7 days</a> &middot; <a href="?period=month">Last 30 days</a></nav>
<section class="card"><h2>Last <%= days %> days in this inventory</h2>
<% if(minutes===null){ %><p>Add a timed sample to estimate the hours saved.</p><% } else { %>
<p><strong><%= (minutes/60).toLocaleString(undefined,{maximumFractionDigits:2}) %> hours</strong> estimated from completed tasks with a timing sample.</p><% } %>
<table><thead><tr><th>Task</th><th>Completed</th><th>Timing samples</th><th>Net minutes saved</th></tr></thead><tbody>
<% rows.forEach(r=>{ %><tr><td><%= r.label %></td><td><%= r.count %></td><td><%= r.samples %></td><td><%= r.minutes===null?'Unmeasured':r.minutes.toLocaleString(undefined,{maximumFractionDigits:2}) %></td></tr><% }); %></tbody></table>
<p>Repeat orders count after the mail provider confirms sending. Supplier responses count once per order and distinct response. Each estimate uses the average manual time minus time your team still spends.</p><% if(coverage){ %><p><%= coverage %> completed tasks in this period still need a timing sample.</p><% } %></section>
<section class="card"><h2>Supplier invoice review</h2>
<% if(amounts.length){ %><table><thead><tr><th>Currency</th><th>Open excess over agreed PO prices</th><th>Supplier credits applied through StockChief’s agent</th></tr></thead><tbody>
<% amounts.forEach(a=>{ %><tr><td><%= a.currency %></td><td><%= a.flagged %></td><td><%= a.applied %></td></tr><% }); %></tbody></table>
<p>The first amount is still disputed. Applied credits have reduced the balance of a supplier bill.</p><% }else{ %><p>No open supplier price differences or agent-applied supplier credits were recorded in this period.</p><% } %>
<% if(planPrice){ %><p>Your account’s base plan is listed at <%= planPrice %> per <%= planInterval %>. This report covers this inventory. <a href="/billing">View billing</a></p><% } %>
</section>
<form class="card" action="/autopilot/time-saved" method="post"><h2>Record a timed sample</h2>
<input type="hidden" name="_csrf" value="<%= csrfToken %>"><input type="hidden" name="requestKey" value="<%= requestKey %>"><input type="hidden" name="period" value="<%= days===7?'week':'month' %>">
<label>Task <select name="activity"><% rows.forEach(r=>{ %><option value="<%= r.key %>"><%= r.label %></option><% }); %></select></label>
<label>Minutes spent doing one example manually <input type="number" name="manualMinutes" min="0" max="1440" step="0.01" required></label>
<label>Minutes spent checking or correcting a comparable StockChief task <input type="number" name="reviewMinutes" min="0" max="1440" step="0.01" required></label>
<button class="btn btn--primary">Save timed sample</button></form>
